  Color-like option names → brush-stroke inline SVG + label. OOS grey like prior lock.
  Single default-variant products still show one chip (Shade).
  Hex: variant.metafields.custom.swatch_hex → else pilot snippet map → else #c8c4bc.
  NO Shopify media upload required for brush swatches.
  2026-10-02: stock-photo disclaimer on every PDP with a featured image.
  Sourced palette colorways use a plain selector; inner pans are the chips.
  Brushes, tools, cases, bags, lashes, fragrance, serum, lotion, shampoo, conditioner, tweezers stay plain text.
  One SKU line follows the selected variant via data-sku.
